config FS_AFFS
	bool "Amiga FFS/OFS (FastFileSystem) support"
	help
	  This provides a read-only driver for the Amiga FastFileSystem (FFS)
	  and OldFileSystem (OFS), as used on AmigaOS / AmigaOne RDB (Rigid
	  Disk Block) partitions (DOS\0 through DOS\7, including the
	  international, dir-cache and long-name variants).  It plugs into
	  U-Boot's generic filesystem framework, so the fstype, ls, load and
	  size commands work on FFS/OFS partitions.
